  "sections": [
    {
      "name": "Verse 1",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Dm/A]Sun of my soul, O [C7/Bb]Savior dear!",
        "[F/C]It is not night if [C]Thou [C7/G]be [F/C]near;",
        "[C]O [Gm/D]may [F/C]no [Bb]earthborn [C]cloud [F/C]a [Bb/F]rise",
        "[Bb]To hide Thee [C/G]from [F]Thy [Gm/D]servant’s [C7/Bb]eyes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Dm/A]When soft the dews of [C7/Bb]kindly sleep",
        "[F/C]My weary eyelids [C]gently [F/C]steep,",
        "[C]Be [Gm/D]my [F/C]last [Bb]thought how [C]sweet [F/C]to [Bb/F]rest",
        "[Bb]Forever [C/G]on [F]my [Gm/D]Savior's [C7/Bb]breast!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Dm/A]Abide with me from [C7/Bb]morn [F/C]till [C7/Bb]eve,",
        "[F/C]For without Thee I [C]cannot [F/C]live;",
        "[C]Abide [F/C]with [Bb]me when [C]night [F/C]is [Bb/F]nigh,",
        "[Bb]For without [C/G]Thee [F]I [Gm/D]dare [F/C]not [C7/Bb]die."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 4",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Dm/A]Be near and bless me [C7/Bb]when [F/C]I [C7/Bb]wake,",
        "[F/C]Ere through the world my [C]way [C7/G]I [F/C]take;",
        "[C]Till [Gm/D]in [F/C]the [Bb]ocean [C]of [F/C]Thy [Bb/F]love",
        "[Bb]I lose myself [C/G]in [F]heaven above."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
